<!-- wp:group {"className":"ifm-legal__body"} -->
<div class="wp-block-group ifm-legal__body"><!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"aim","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="aim"><span>01</span> Our aim</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) version 2.2 at level AA, the standard most widely used in the UK.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"done","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="done"><span>02</span> What we have done</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:list {"className":"ifm-ticks"} -->
<ul class="wp-block-list ifm-ticks"><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Pages use proper headings, lists and landmarks so screen readers can move around them.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>The menu, the plan picker, the comparison table and the forms can all be used with a keyboard, and the focus position is always visible.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Colour combinations were checked for contrast, and colour is never the only way information is shown.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Text can be enlarged to 200% without losing content.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Animations are turned off when your device is set to reduce motion.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Illustrations have text descriptions, and decorative images are hidden from screen readers.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"limits","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="limits"><span>03</span> Known limitations</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:list {"className":"ifm-ticks"} -->
<ul class="wp-block-list ifm-ticks"><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>The basket, checkout and account pages are provided by WooCommerce. We style them, but we have not been able to test every step with assistive technology.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Illustrations are images of example screens. Their descriptions summarise them, but not every label is read out.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Some older blog posts may contain images without descriptions.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We tested the site with keyboard-only use and automated checks on phone, tablet and desktop sizes. We have not yet commissioned an independent audit.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"help","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="help"><span>04</span> If you need information in another way</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
